  "Body": {
    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>Kubernetes version 1.26 support in AKS is now generally available. You can now take advantage of the v1.26 features in production.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>To learn more about features in 1.26, see&nbsp;<a href=\"https://kubernetes.io/releases/patch-releases/#1-26\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Patch Releases | Kubernetes</a> and&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/blob/master/CHANGELOG/CHANGELOG-1.26.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Kubernetes 1.26 changelog.</a></p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "Kubernetes version 1.26 support in AKS is now generally available. You can now take advantage of the v1.26 features in production.\n\nTo learn more about features in 1.26, see Patch Releases | Kubernetes and Kubernetes 1.26 changelog."
  },
